# AGENTS.md is a *hardlink* to CLAUDE.md (same inode, so the two cannot drift), created
# because this repo's instruction file is read under both names by different agent tools.
# It is ignored rather than committed: committing it would put a second, independent copy
# of the content in git, which is exactly the drift the link exists to prevent.
#
# Recreate after a fresh clone (Git Bash, from the repo root):
#     cmd //c mklink //H AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md
# A true symlink needs Administrator or Windows Developer Mode; the hardlink does not.
# Caveat: an editor that saves by writing a temp file and renaming it over CLAUDE.md will
# silently break the link. `diff -q CLAUDE.md AGENTS.md` checks it in one command.
AGENTS.md

# Ad-hoc screenshots dropped in the repo root while inspecting the UI.
Captura de pantalla*.png

# Database dumps written by scripts/db-dump-push.sh -- one file, overwritten each time.
backups/
